+/* HarmonyBus overlay exposes exactly two quartets:
+ * group 0 = native Move tracks 1-4
+ * group 1 = HarmonyBus source tracks 5-8
+ * Keep the engine's TRACK_COUNT at 16 elsewhere because the Movy engine/status
